  "summary": "Malicious code in statist-browser-typed-client-integration.tecm.events (npm)",
  "details": "Package \"statist-browser-typed-client-integration.tecm.events\" is a combosquat name-squatting registration impersonating a real package/domain. It ships an empty module (module.exports = {}) with no functional code, no install hooks, and no dependencies — a placeholder registration under a name designed to be mistaken for a legitimate package. The publisher has previously published confirmed-malicious packages, and this empty stub appears to be a reserved name for a future supply-chain payload.",
